# Build context is the monorepo root (docker-compose.rukny-dev.yml).
# App-level .dockerignore files are ignored when context is `.`.

**/node_modules
apps/*/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.git
**/.cursor
**/agent-transcripts

**/*.md
!**/*/README.md

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.production
!**/.env.production.*

**/tmp
**/temp
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*

# Local IDE / OS
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea
**/.vscode
